# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CRITICAL: models/ and data/ directories, and .pkl/.csv files, are
# INTENTIONALLY NOT ignored. Streamlit Community Cloud deploys directly
# from this repo with no separate build/training step — the trained
# model bundle and district dataset MUST be committed so the app can
# boot immediately on deploy. Do not add data/, models/, *.pkl, or *.csv
# to this file.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
